      "deriveFrom": "design-status-page-incident-detail.html",
      "derivationNotes": "Same StatusPageLayout shell, breadcrumb, header, and timeline structure as IncidentDetail. Replace severity badge with a maintenance pill (indigo bg, indigo text, 'SCHEDULED MAINTENANCE'). Replace severity-colored left border with maintenance indigo. Header subtitle shows scheduled window 'YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM UTC -> HH:MM UTC' in mono with a duration pill. Affected components row identical. Timeline updates use the maintenance status chain (Scheduled / In Progress / Verifying / Completed) instead of incident chain (Investigating / Identified / Monitoring / Resolved); status dot colors map: Scheduled=maintenance indigo, In Progress=degraded amber, Verifying=accent indigo, Completed=operational emerald. No 'Post update' draft area when status is Completed. Right rail stays the same metadata sidebar but replaces 'Severity' with 'Type: Planned maintenance' and 'Created by' with 'Scheduled by'. All other tokens, borders, fonts, badges identical."
    },
